Cline Desktop Simplified Chinese Runtime Patch

This repository includes generated translation dictionary content derived from
the Cline Desktop typed localization catalogs in Cline/Cline:
https://github.com/cline/cline

Generation baseline: Desktop 0.0.28, commit
a7a792af83d6db1317f11475064866e92a4c72e8.

